values ('ap_physics_c_mechanics', 2, '2.6', array['2.6']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Apparent weight', 'The magnitude of a system''s apparent weight is the magnitude of the normal force exerted on it, which differs from the gravitational force when the system accelerates.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Apparent weight is the normal force, not the gravitational force.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-c-mechanics-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_c_mechanics-u2-r1-024; ced=2.6.C.1 "magnitude of the normal force exerted on the system"; 2.6.C.2')
