values ('ap_physics_c_mechanics', 2, '2.6', array['2.6']::text[], 'list_sequence', 'Newton''s shell theorem results', 'Net gravitational force from a uniform spherical shell or sphere on an object, depending on location (the theorem need not be proved).', '[{"label": "Inside a thin spherical shell", "meaning": "Net gravitational force is zero"}, {"label": "Outside a thin spherical shell", "meaning": "Treat the shell as a single mass at its center"}, {"label": "Inside a uniform sphere", "meaning": "Only the partial mass at distance less than or equal to the object''s distance from the center contributes"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Do not prove or derive the shell theorem; state and apply the results.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-c-mechanics-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_c_mechanics-u2-r1-028; ced=2.6.E.2.i-2.6.E.2.iii and Boundary Statement')
